              "content": "Search and retrieve meeting summaries with optional filters. Returns summaries for meetings where the authenticated user is the owner, or if workspace-wide access is enabled via admin settings, workspace admins can access summaries from all workspace members' meetings. Requires the mixmaxApi feature (API access enabled for your workspace).",
